:: \ I am going to Chinnaswamy Stadium {"position":"700,650","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#fa5252)[[Walks to Chinnaswamy]] 


:: \ Nah I'll just stay at home {"position":"1000,500","size":"100,100"}
You are at home and you are watching the live broadcast of the trophy parade which is happening in Vidhan Soudha. You get a call from your friend
(text-colour:#2b8a3e)[[Pick the call]]
(text-colour:#c92a2a)[[Ignore the call]]



:: Avoids the crowded line and tries to find another gate {"position":"600,900","size":"100,100"}
As you walk around the stadium to find another gate you get stuck in between the crowd, you find yourself out of the crowd 
(text-colour:#37b24d)[[You decide to go home instead of risking your life]]
(text-colour:#f03e3e)[[You want to go with the adrenaline rush and join the crowd so that you enter the stadium]]



:: Continue to stay cuz you think its worth it {"position":"875,1000","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:(hsl:0,1,0.7098,0.35))[You stay in the crowd and the gate of the stadium is suddenly open and peolple with all the force push you towards the gate. You fall with the force and all the people trample over you, with no one helping you out and you die on spot.
The End]
(text-colour:(hsl:0,0.8039,0.5,0.65))[[More on the Chinnaswamy Stampede Tragedy]]


:: Continues going in with the crowd {"position":"750,875","size":"100,100"}
As you keep walking with the crowd, you realise the gates of the stadium are all closed causing people more and more to gather and join the crowd. 
(text-colour:#0c8599)[[Try to get out of the crowd]]
(text-colour:#ffec99)[[Continue to stay cuz you think its worth it]]



:: Ignore the call {"position":"1175,550","size":"100,100"}
Be a good friend 
(text-colour:orange)[[Pick the call]] 


:: More on the Chinnaswamy Stampede Tragedy {"position":"700,1300","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:(hsl:0,0.8039,0.5,0.65))[A Documentary on the Stampede]
<iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/vlKoJoHnLfw?si=0wrzmshVHP-T5lrv" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>


:: Pick the call {"position":"975,650","size":"100,100"}
You pick the call and turns out your friend is stuck in the stampede and he needs your help to get out of there as he has no ride back home 
(text-colour: "red")[[you decide to help him by picking him up]]
(text-colour:#fab005)[[you make an excuse and not pick him up]]



:: Start the Game {"position":"675,375","size":"100,100"}
Your favourtite team ''Royal Challengers Bangalore'' just won their first ever Indian Premiere League title. There is gonna be a victory celebration in the Chinnaswamy stadium. 
Choose an option
(text-colour:#a61e4d)[[ I am going to Chinnaswamy Stadium]]
[[ Nah I'll just stay at home]]


:: Try to get out of the crowd {"position":"750,1000","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#0ca678)[You try to get out of the crowd, but as more people gathered around you it makes it difficult to get out so you get crushed in the crowd and you fall unconscious and later taken to the hospital due to your rib cage becoming fractured from all the crowds impact 
The End]
(text-colour:(hsl:0,0.8039,0.5,0.65))[[More on the Chinnaswamy Stampede Tragedy]]


:: Untitled Passage {"position":"700,275","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:(hsl:288,0.5446,0.3961,0.45))[[Start the Game]]



:: Walks to Chinnaswamy {"position":"600,775","size":"100,100"}
You start going to Chinnaswamy Stadium, you see a huge crowd, you start walking in the line leading inside Chinnaswamy. 
(text-colour:#ae3ec9)[[Avoids the crowded line and tries to find another gate]]
(text-colour:#7048e8)[[Continues going in with the crowd]]


:: You decide to go home instead of risking your life {"position":"500,1025","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#69db7c)[ As you decided to home, you are walking to the metro station, but its closed due to the stampede which is starting to being formed outside the stadium. So you walk to Shivajinagar Bus Stand and hail a bus home.
The End ]
(text-colour:(hsl:0,0.8039,0.5,0.65))[[More on the Chinnaswamy Stampede Tragedy]]


:: You want to go with the adrenaline rush and join the crowd so that you enter the stadium {"position":"625,1075","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#fa5252)[You jump into the crowd and the crowd pushes you into the closed gates of the stadium and your lungs get congested because of it and fall unconscious, you are then safely taken to the Fortis Hospital Cunningham Road where you gain you consciousness with your parents by your side along with the Chief Minister next to you asking about your well being
The End]
(text-colour:(hsl:0,0.8039,0.5,0.65))[[More on the Chinnaswamy Stampede Tragedy]]


:: you decide to help him by picking him up {"position":"1150,750","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:(hsl:85,0.7864,0.4039,0.45))[You come to the stadium area, to find him standing near Cubbon park metro station. You pick him up in your car and go through all the traffic.
The End]
(text-colour:(hsl:0,0.8039,0.5,0.65))[[More on the Chinnaswamy Stampede Tragedy]]


:: you make an excuse and not pick him up {"position":"950,825","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:(hsl:21,0.9016,0.4784,0.45))[As you did not pick him up, your friend gets stuck in the stampede and gets crushed by the crowd and he dies. 
The End ]
(text-colour:(hsl:0,0.8039,0.5,0.65))[[More on the Chinnaswamy Stampede Tragedy]]
